WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.439 --> 00:00:08.710
What's up with the caravan of Central
Americans planning to cross the US

00:00:08.710 --> 00:00:12.550
border illegally? Tragically, it appears
that desperate people have been made

00:00:12.550 --> 00:00:17.739
part of a dangerous stunt. El Salvador,
Guatemala, and Honduras sit in a transit

00:00:17.739 --> 00:00:22.180
zone for illegal drugs heading to US
consumers who abuse chemicals to escape

00:00:22.180 --> 00:00:25.000
there first-world problems.
Central American governments are

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:29.529
unwilling or unable to take on drug
traffickers who are flush with cash and

00:00:29.529 --> 00:00:34.660
armed to the teeth. Vicious gangs murder,
extort, and force young men into their

00:00:34.660 --> 00:00:40.000
ranks. Insecurity scares off investment
and chokes off commerce. Every day,

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:44.560
thousands of poor try to sneak across
the US border, but the caravan is

00:00:44.560 --> 00:00:48.850
made for television, exploiting desperate
migrants to embarrass local authorities,

00:00:48.850 --> 00:00:54.220
defy US law, and sow chaos. President Trump already has said he will cut off US aid,

00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:58.450
which will undermine programs that help
our neighbors fight drug trafficking and

00:00:58.450 --> 00:01:03.399
build healthier, safer homelands. So the
caravan has done a lot of damage,

00:01:03.400 --> 00:01:08.040
dividing and distracting countries that
should be working together.

00:01:08.040 --> 00:01:12.060
What do you think about the caravan that's headed
into the US border? Let us know in your

00:01:12.070 --> 00:01:15.909
comments, and let us know what other
topics you'd like our scholars to cover

00:01:15.909 --> 00:01:20.530
in 60 seconds, and be sure to like and
subscribe for more research and videos

00:01:20.530 --> 00:01:23.310
from AEI.

